RETURN cdg, r, to\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2.1.9 Graph of all routes delivered by an A380,\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 MATCH (cdg:Airport) <-- (r:Route) --> (to:Airport) \
WHERE r.equipment CONTAINS '380'\
RETURN cdg, r, to\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2.1.10 Graph of all routes coming from a French airport to British airport (United Kingdom),\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 MATCH (FR:Airport\{country:'France'\}) <-[:from]- (r:Route) -[:to]-> (UK:Airport\{country:'United Kingdom'\}) \
RETURN FR, r, UK\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2.1.11 From previous result, give the distinct list of airline names,\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 MATCH (FR:Airport\{country:'France'\}) <-[:from]- (r:Route) -[:to]-> (UK:Airport\{country:'United Kingdom'\}),\
	(r) -[:by]-> (comp)\
RETURN DISTINCT comp.name\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2.1.12 Idem, but only for which they are delivered by an A320.\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 MATCH (FR:Airport\{country:'France'\}) <-[:from]- (r:Route) -[:to]-> (UK:Airport\{country:'United Kingdom'\}),\
	(r) -[:by]-> (comp)\
